      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "24. 1f you desire to see the courage of magnanimous",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "persons give way in times of difficulty, desist from this",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "wicked pursuit, all trouble in which must be fruitless—",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "O you block-head these are not the Kula–mountains nor the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "oceans either which transgress their usual bounds at the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "time of the universal destruction—but insignificant on",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "that account.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "translated_stanza",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "25. The goddess of victory likes the chest of warriors",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "lacerated with the nail-like-long sword, just as an ac-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "complished and grown up handsome woman longs for the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "chest of brave men scratched by her nails long and piercing",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "like a sword.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
